{"seq":3,"slug":"markets","title":"保险市场与创新","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/markets","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"insurance-market-structure","title":"保险市场结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/markets/insurance-market-structure","wordCount":1934,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"insurtech-digital-transformation","title":"保险科技与数字化转型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/markets/insurtech-digital-transformation","wordCount":2097,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"parametric-climate-insurance","title":"参数保险与气候风险","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/markets/parametric-climate-insurance","wordCount":2104,"readingTime":9}],"introMarkdown":"# 保险市场与创新\n\n本章从产业组织视角审视保险市场的结构、竞争与演化。保险市场并非完全竞争市场——高度监管、信息壁垒、规模经济和网络效应共同塑造了其独特的竞争格局。\n\n三篇文档依次覆盖：传统保险市场的产业组织分析，InsurTech 驱动的数字化转型浪潮，以及参数保险与气候保险这一 2026 年增长最快的前沿领域。从市场结构的静态分析过渡到技术驱动的动态变革，帮助读者建立对保险行业全景的理解。\n"}